<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ TELL-TALE: Task Efficient LLMs with Task Aware Layer Elimination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompting.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In TELL-TALE: Task Efficient LLMs with Task Aware Layer Elimination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Number of parameters per layer for each model</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In TELL-TALE: Task Efficient LLMs with Task Aware Layer Elimination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Intution behind <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Tale </span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In TELL-TALE: Task Efficient LLMs with Task Aware Layer Elimination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Results on few-shot learning on larger models</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In TELL-TALE: Task Efficient LLMs with Task Aware Layer Elimination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>A tunable metric for finding accuracy vs. speed up optimization</span></a></li>
