</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.89 13.35)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.32em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="62.88" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="530.24"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.32em;">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p5.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p5.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">”You are a helpful assistant that answers multiple-choice questions requiring commonsense knowledge and reasoning. Read each question carefully and select the most logical answer from the given options based on common knowledge and reasoning. Respond with only the letter of your chosen answer (A, B, C, D, or E).”</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="86.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 86.52" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,86.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000099;" fill="#000099" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.18 L 0 83.34 C 0 85.1 1.42 86.52 3.18 86.52 L 546.82 86.52 C 548.58 86.52 550 85.1 550 83.34 L 550 3.18 C 550 1.42 548.58 0 546.82 0 L 3.18 0 C 1.42 0 0 1.42 0 3.18 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7FF;" fill="#F7F7FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 3.18 L 0.42 65.64 L 549.58 65.64 L 549.58 3.18 C 549.58 1.65 548.35 0.42 546.82 0.42 L 3.18 0.42 C 1.65 0.42 0.42 1.65 0.42 3.18 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.89 72.68)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.32em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="461.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
