<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Intution behind <span id="A3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Tale </span></h2>

<figure id="A3.F5" class="ltx_figure">
