<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>A tunable metric for finding accuracy vs. speed up optimization</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To systematically select among these candidates according to user priorities, we propose the Accuracy–Efficiency Harmonic Mean (AE-HM):</p>
<table id="A5.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{A}=\frac{\text{Acc}(\text{Model})}{\text{Acc}(\text{Baseline})},\qquad\text{AE-HM}(\text{Model})=\frac{(1+\lambda^{2})r_{A}\,S}{\lambda^{2}S+r_{A}}=\frac{1+\lambda^{2}}{\frac{\lambda^{2}}{r_{A}}+\frac{1}{S}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Acc</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Model</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mtext>Acc</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Baseline</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>AE-HM</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Model</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>S</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{A}=\frac{\text{Acc}(\text{Model})}{\text{Acc}(\text{Baseline})},\qquad\text{AE-HM}(\text{Model})=\frac{(1+\lambda^{2})r_{A}\,S}{\lambda^{2}S+r_{A}}=\frac{1+\lambda^{2}}{\frac{\lambda^{2}}{r_{A}}+\frac{1}{S}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the relative inference speedup and <math id="A5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> controls the relative importance of accuracy versus efficiency. The user can set AE-HE’s parameter <math id="A5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> to desired specifications: if <math id="A5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>, we prioritize <math id="A5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{A}</annotation></semantics></math>; if <math id="A5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math> we prioritize Speedup.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">By computing AE-HM for candidate models, we can automatically identify the model with the highest score for a given task or a set of tasks given a particular AE-HM parameter setting:</p>
<table id="A5.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\text{best-compromise}}=\arg\max_{i}\text{AE-HM}(M_{i})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>best-compromise</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>i</mi></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>AE-HM</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\text{best-compromise}}=\arg\max_{i}\text{AE-HM}(M_{i})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.22767v1/img/plot_bar_tale.png" id="A5.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/224;" width="548" height="224" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Relative Gain comparison across datasets. LLaMA <math id="A5.F6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=3</annotation></semantics></math></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Deleted Layers in each Model and Benchmark</h2>

<figure id="A6.T6" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A6.T6.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:417.4pt;height:116.5pt;vertical-align:-55.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(13.1pt,-3.7pt) scale(1.06719582444122,1.06719582444122) ;">
<table id="A6.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A6.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
